35:50.800 --> 35:51.440
Sudah merepotkan kalian.

35:51.920 --> 35:52.480
Hati-hati di jalan.

35:53.840 --> 35:54.760
Terima kasih, Pak Xu.

35:55.360 --> 35:55.880
Terima kasih.

